                "_key": "fs-lead-s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "At SAIS - UAQ, we recognize that proper nutrition is the cornerstone of student well-being and academic success. Our “Food and Nutrition” program is designed to nourish young minds and bodies, fostering healthy habits that support growth, concentration, and lifelong wellness."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Growing Strong Minds Through\nGood Nutrition"
