              {
                "_key": "fs-team-1-s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "All members of the canteen staff hold valid certifications from the Umm Al Quwain Municipality and the Ministry of Health. They participate in ongoing training on food safety, nutritional standards, and customer care to ensure every meal meets the highest quality and safety benchmarks."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "fs-team-2",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "fs-team-2-s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "By integrating balanced nutrition with impeccable hygiene practices, our Food and Nutrition page underscores the pivotal role our canteen plays in promoting a healthy, positive school experience for every student."
